### ============================================
### ADMIN FAQ CRUD TESTS
### ============================================
### Test all FAQ management endpoints
### Requires: Admin authentication with super_admin or super_inventory_admin role

### 1. Get All FAQs (No Filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Get All FAQs (With Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs?search=pembayaran
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Get All FAQs (Filter by Category)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs?category=umum
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Get All FAQs (Filter by Status - Active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs?is_active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Get All FAQs (Filter by Status - Inactive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs?is_active=false
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Get All FAQs (With Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Get FAQ by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Create New FAQ
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Bagaimana cara melakukan pemesanan?",
  "answer": "Anda dapat melakukan pemesanan dengan cara: 1. Pilih produk yang diinginkan, 2. Tambahkan ke keranjang, 3. Lakukan checkout dan pembayaran. Pesanan akan diproses setelah pembayaran dikonfirmasi.",
  "category": "umum",
  "order_number": 1,
  "is_active": true
}

### 9. Create FAQ - Pembayaran
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Metode pembayaran apa saja yang tersedia?",
  "answer": "Kami menyediakan berbagai metode pembayaran: Transfer Bank (BCA, Mandiri, BRI), E-wallet (OVO, GoPay, Dana), dan COD (Cash on Delivery) untuk area tertentu.",
  "category": "pembayaran",
  "order_number": 1,
  "is_active": true
}

### 10. Update FAQ
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Bagaimana cara melakukan pemesanan produk?",
  "answer": "Anda dapat melakukan pemesanan dengan mudah melalui website kami: 1. Browse produk, 2. Tambah ke keranjang, 3. Checkout dan bayar. Tim kami akan segera memproses pesanan Anda!",
  "category": "umum",
  "order_number": 1,
  "is_active": true
}

### 11. Update FAQ Status (Deactivate)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 12. Update FAQ Status (Activate)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": true
}

### 13. Bulk Update FAQ Order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/bulk-order
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "faqs": [
    { "id": 1, "order_number": 1 },
    { "id": 2, "order_number": 2 },
    { "id": 3, "order_number": 3 }
  ]
}

### 14. Get FAQ Category Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/categories/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 15. Delete FAQ
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 16. Validation Test - Empty Question
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "",
  "answer": "Ini adalah jawaban test",
  "category": "umum"
}

### 17. Validation Test - Short Answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Ini adalah pertanyaan test yang cukup panjang",
  "answer": "Pendek",
  "category": "umum"
}

### 18. Test Unauthorized Access (No Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs

### 19. Test with Invalid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here
